{"result":"ok","response":"collection","data":[{"id":"de2bb316-0533-4f1a-b789-4776ef673dd4","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"ja-ro":"Takou no Ichigun Gyaru to Eki no Hoomu de Hajimaru Aoharu"},"altTitles":[{"ja":"\u4ed6\u6821\u306e\u4e00\u8ecd\u30ae\u30e3\u30eb\u3068\u99c5\u306e\u30db\u30fc\u30e0\u3067\u59cb\u307e\u308b\u30a2\u30aa\u30cf\u30eb"},{"en":"My Youth Begins on a Train Platform with a Top-Tier Gal from Another School."},{"es-la":"Mi juventud comienza en el and\u00e9n de la estaci\u00f3n con la gyaru de m\u00e1s alto nivel de otra escuela"}],"description":{"en":"Every morning at the station, he sees Shiraishi Kotoha, a beautiful girl from another school. With her long honey-colored hair and loosely worn uniform, she's a top-tier gyaru who makes everyone stop and stare. Keitarou, a high school boy who once saved Kotoha from being secretly filmed, starts running into her on the platform every morning. She gives him sweet smiles, suddenly grabs his hand... Her sense of personal space is oddly close, and every day he's left with his heart pounding and his head spinning\u2014!? A sweet and sugary \"commute-time romcom\" that begins with the brief moments before the train arrives!\u266a","ja":"\u671d\u3001\u99c5\u3067\u898b\u304b\u3051\u308b\u4ed6\u6821\u306e\u7f8e\u5c11\u5973\u30fb\u767d\u77f3\u7434\u8449\u3002\u8702\u871c\u8272\u306e\u9577\u9aea\u306b\u3001\u3086\u308b\u304f\u7740\u5d29\u3057\u305f\u5236\u670d\u3002\u8ab0\u3082\u304c\u8db3\u3092\u6b62\u3081\u898b\u60da\u308c\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3046\u4e00\u8ecd\u30ae\u30e3\u30eb\u3060\u3002 \u305d\u3093\u306a\u7434\u8449\u3092\u76d7\u64ae\u304b\u3089\u52a9\u3051\u305f\u7537\u5b50\u9ad8\u751f\u30fb\u666f\u592a\u90ce\u306f\u3001\u6bce\u671d\u99c5\u306e\u30db\u30fc\u30e0\u3067\u5f7c\u5973\u3068\u9854\u3092\u5408\u308f\u305b\u308b\u3088\u3046\u306b\u306a\u308b\u3002 \u7518\u304f\u5fae\u7b11\u307f\u304b\u3051\u3089\u308c\u305f\u308a\u3001\u3044\u304d\u306a\u308a\u624b\u3092\u63e1\u3089\u308c\u305f\u308a\u2026 \u3084\u3051\u306b\u8ddd\u96e2\u611f\u306e\u8fd1\u3044\u7434\u8449\u306b\u3001\u6bce\u65e5\u30c9\u30ad\u30c9\u30ad\u632f\u308a\u56de\u3055\u308c\u308b\u3070\u304b\u308a\u3067\u2014\u2014!? \u96fb\u8eca\u304c\u6765\u308b\u307e\u3067\u306e\u3072\u3068\u3068\u304d\u304b\u3089\u59cb\u307e\u308b\u3001\u9752\u304f\u3066\u7518\u3044\u201c\u901a\u5b66\u6642\u9593\u30e9\u30d6\u30b3\u30e1\u201d\u958b\u5e55\u266a","es-la":"Todas las ma\u00f1anas en la estaci\u00f3n, \u00e9l ve a Shiraishi Kotoha, una hermosa chica de otra escuela. Con su largo cabello color miel y su uniforme llevado de forma desali\u00f1ada, es una gyaru de primer nivel que hace que todos se detengan a mirarla. Keitarou, un estudiante de preparatoria que una vez salv\u00f3 a Kotoha de ser grabada en secreto, empieza a toparse con ella en el and\u00e9n todas las ma\u00f1anas. Ella le regala dulces sonrisas, de pronto le agarra la mano... Su sentido del espacio personal es extra\u00f1amente cercano, y cada d\u00eda \u00e9l termina con el coraz\u00f3n latiendo a mil y la cabeza dando vueltas, \u00bf\u00a1eh!? Una \u201ccomedia rom\u00e1ntica de camino al trabajo\/colegio\u201d, dulce y azucarada, que comienza con los breves momentos antes de que llegue el tren\u266a"},"isLocked":false,"links":{"al":"219760","mu":"pplt26l","nu":"when-i-kept-running-into-a-popular-gal-from-another-school-on-the-train-platform-every-morning-i-started-to-feel-like-she-was-gradually-hitting-me-with-some-pretty-heavy-emotions","mal":"197837","raw":"https:\/\/www.manga-up.com\/titles\/1801"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ja","lastVolume":"","lastChapter":"","publicationDemographic":null,"status":"ongoing","year":2026,"contentRating":"safe","tags":[{"id":"423e2eae-a7a2-4a8b-ac03-a8351462d71d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Romance"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"4d32cc48-9f00-4cca-9b5a-a839f0764984","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Comedy"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"caaa44eb-cd40-4177-b930-79d3ef2afe87","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"School Life"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"e5301a23-ebd9-49dd-a0cb-2add944c7fe9","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Slice of Life"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"f4122d1c-3b44-44d0-9936-ff7502c39ad3","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Adaptation"},"description":{},"group":"format","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"fad12b5e-68ba-460e-b933-9ae8318f5b65","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Gyaru"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]}],"state":"published","chapterNumbersResetOnNewVolume":false,"createdAt":"2026-11-08T17:34:39+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-12T19:04:47+00:00","version":9,"availableTranslatedLanguages":["id","vi","en","es-la"],"latestUploadedChapter":"aa0ef840-3b46-4d0c-8c0e-97d59da25098"},"relationships":[{"id":"c69723a2-89b1-4a94-b6fe-6db883c042e8","type":"author","attributes":{"name":"Arabara","imageUrl":null,"biography":{},"twitter":null,"pixiv":null,"melonBook":null,"fanBox":null,"booth":null,"namicomi":null,"nicoVideo":null,"skeb":null,"fantia":null,"tumblr":null,"youtube":null,"weibo":null,"naver":null,"website":null,"createdAt":"2026-07-18T20:58:21+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-07-18T20:58:21+00:00","version":1}},{"id":"a2853de6-0e2c-47c7-b476-761fe7ebe969","type":"artist","attributes":{"name":"Takoyaki Inko (\u305f\u3053\u3084\u304d\u3044\u3093\u3053)","imageUrl":null,"biography":{},"twitter":null,"pixiv":null,"melonBook":null,"fanBox":null,"booth":null,"namicomi":null,"nicoVideo":null,"skeb":null,"fantia":null,"tumblr":null,"youtube":null,"weibo":null,"naver":null,"website":null,"createdAt":"2026-11-08T17:32:35+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T17:32:35+00:00","version":1}},{"id":"cf55ba75-5e2e-4ee9-8c23-4ebbec729516","type":"cover_art","attributes":{"description":"","volume":"0.1","fileName":"9a1a9976-08e4-420b-9fdb-d5c31d339922.png","locale":"ja","createdAt":"2026-11-08T17:34:41+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-08T17:34:41+00:00","version":1}},{"id":"fc6e9df7-5c5f-43de-b1d2-949bd953fbd2","type":"creator"}]},{"id":"6794951f-5026-4390-ac08-332a72b8dbed","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"ja-ro":"Tonari no Heya no Dwarf-san"},"altTitles":[{"ja":"\u96a3\u306e\u90e8\u5c4b\u306e\u30c9\u30ef\u30fc\u30d5\u3055\u3093"},{"en":"The Dwarf Next Door"}],"description":{"en":"Sosuke, a salaryman worn down by his black company job, gets a new neighbor: Alma, a beautiful dwarf from another world! She's always drunk, but she's actually over 100 years old and a master craftswoman. After she gives the overworked Sosuke a magic ring, the two end up drinking together in his room... Somehow they become business partners, and the more they drink, the closer they get...!?","ja":"\u30d6\u30e9\u30c3\u30af\u4f01\u696d\u3067\u50cd\u304f\u30b5\u30e9\u30ea\u30fc\u30de\u30f3\u30fb\u30bd\u30a6\u30b9\u30b1\u306e\u96a3\u5ba4\u306b\u5f15\u3063\u8d8a\u3057\u3066\u304d\u305f\u306e\u306f\u3001\u7570\u4e16\u754c\u304b\u3089\u3084\u3063\u3066\u304d\u305f\u30c9\u30ef\u30fc\u30d5\u306e\u7f8e\u5973\u30fb\u30a2\u30eb\u30de\uff01\u3044\u3064\u3082\u9154\u3063\u3071\u3089\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3051\u3069\u3001\u5b9f\u306f\uff11\uff10\uff10\u624d\u3092\u8d85\u3048\u308b\u3001\u30e2\u30ce\u4f5c\u308a\u306e\u30b9\u30da\u30b7\u30e3\u30ea\u30b9\u30c8\u306e\u5f7c\u5973\u3002\u904e\u52b4\u6c17\u5473\u306e\u30bd\u30a6\u30b9\u30b1\u306b\u9b54\u6cd5\u306e\u6307\u8f2a\u3092\u30d7\u30ec\u30bc\u30f3\u30c8\u3057\u305f\u3053\u3068\u3092\u304d\u3063\u304b\u3051\u306b\u3001\u4e8c\u4eba\u306f\u90e8\u5c4b\u98f2\u307f\u3059\u308b\u3053\u3068\u306b\u2026\uff01\u3072\u3087\u3093\u306a\u3053\u3068\u304b\u3089\u30d3\u30b8\u30cd\u30b9\u30d1\u30fc\u30c8\u30ca\u30fc\u306b\u306a\u3063\u305f\u4e8c\u4eba\u306e\u95a2\u4fc2\u306f\u3001\u98f2\u3081\u3070\u98f2\u3080\u307b\u3069\u306b\u8fd1\u3065\u3044\u3066\u2026\uff01\uff1f"},"isLo